{"channelId":"UC5RkpPgffvzUGvqZANWP7Vw","row":["Whispering Hearts Horse Rescue, Hagersville Ontario",372,"Whispering Hearts Horse Rescue Center is a federally registered non-profit organization with charitable status.\n\nOur mandate is \nTo provide care and rehabilitation \nto abused and neglected horses. \nTo assist members of the community \nthat can no longer care for their horses \nin an attempt to prevent innocent animals \nbeing subjected to cruelty and neglect.\n\nOur Goals and Objectives are:\n\nCreate a volunteer-based, equine welfare organization to ensure quality care and treatment of horses through intervention, education and outreach. \n\nCreate a partnership to provide a reputable facility for the care and rehabilitation of horses under investigation.\n\nEducate the public on equine welfare issues\n\nEstablish a program to assist other rescue organizations in Ontario as more facilities are needed to take in the increasing number of abused and neglected horses across the Province.","","Canada"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5RkpPgffvzUGvqZANWP7Vw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5RkpPgffvzUGvqZANWP7Vw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:10.878Z","channelId":"UC5RkpPgffvzUGvqZANWP7Vw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"49555de42b794b968dcd89ff94ea10b9188aad46afe7056ec5b7a5a86d943ed5","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"cd7e387313e19e6073aa74125ad354020d774d12d6d568f0b11a2d57fd32ae38"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5RkpPgffvzUGvqZANWP7Vw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:10.878Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5RkpPgffvzUGvqZANWP7Vw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":372,"raw":"372 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5RkpPgffvzUGvqZANWP7Vw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:10.878Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relev